2520               /ERROR.
2521               /BECAUSE OF PREVIOUS CHECK FOR DX = 0, A ZERO DIVISOR CAN NEVER OCCUR IN THIS GRAPHICS PROGRAM2522               
2523               /AND BECAUSE THIS DIVIDE ROUTINE IS CALLED ONLY IN THE CONTEXT OF SOME X COORDINATE * DY / DX
2524               /AND IT HAS BEEN CAREFULLY ARRANGED THAT DY IS LESS THAN OR EQUAL TO DX, THE QUOTIENT OVERFLOW2525               
2526               /CONDITION CAN NEVER ARISE IN THIS GRAPHICS PROGRAM.  THE ERROR EXIT, THEREFORE, CAN NEVER
2527               /BE TAKEN AND THE SET LINK IS NOT CHECKED FOR UPON RETURN.  THE CODE IS LEFT IN ONLY FOR
2528               /GENERALITY.
