4372               /THIS IS A SHORTENED VERSION OF THE PROGRAM UTIL10 WHICH IS USED
4373               /TO LOGIN AND LOGOUT THE DEC-10.  ONE ARGUMENT IS USED. IF THE
4374               /ARGUMENT IS 1, THE ACTION IS LOGIN; IF 0 THE ACTION IS LOGOUT.
4375               /WORD 7777 OF FIELD 1 (SYS AREA) IS PRESUMED AS A STATUS WORD.
4376               /BIT 11 IF SET INDICATES LOGGED IN; IF CLEAR,LOGGED OUT. 
4377               /OTHER BITS ARE USED FOR OTHER PUTPOSES BY OTHER PROGRAMS, BUT 
4378               /ARE NOT RELEVANT HERE.
